  "name": "Export BMP (savebmp)",
  "category": [
    "files-sequences",
    "export"
  ],
  "description": "Saves current image under the form of a bitmap file with 8-bit per channel: filename .bmp (BMP 24-bit)\n\nUses fixed input references and writes only invocation-owned outputs. Optional argument values are sent only when their use_* control is true; zero is preserved.",
